WEBVTT

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.620
There are so many people!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Well, it's summer after all.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.880
Let's make up for the time we lost last time.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.760
Murasame-san, would you teach
me how to swim later?

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.010
Ah, sure.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:38.570
Look, Ushio-chan — they have a diving board!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.770
The pool? Tomorrow?

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:39.510
Aoi-san's parents got tickets for all of us.

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:44.810
They're an apology for having to cancel the trip.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.890
The training camp?

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.430
So I believe.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:53.310
How about it? Everyone else is going.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:59.530
Of course, since Aoi-san will be with us, we have to make sure she doesn't find out about your brother.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.950
Oh, that's easy!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.460
It should be fine, provided I don't get too close to her.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:10.830
There won't be a problem as long as I'm the one farthest away from her.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.420
You're right!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.170
There will be six people!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:17.340
The more people between you two, the less you'll have to talk!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.010
Then, you'll come?

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.590
Of course!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.930
I'm horrible at swimming though,
so would you teach me, Sumi-chan?

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.390
Of course!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:33.150
Your arms, legs, chest, and hips —
I will teach you thoroughly!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.070
Geez, Sumi-chan — you sound like an old man!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.360
Is that so?

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.660
It's no good!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.330
Murasame-san?

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.870
Aoi-san barely knows anyone but me!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.370
There's no one but me for her to hang out with!

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.120
What's the matter?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.010
They have curry dogs over there, Kiyori-chan.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.210
Let's have a look!

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.780
Kiyori-chan?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.350
The adult team...

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:15.770
...and the kids team!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.230
Hold it!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.430
What?

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:22.990
Just how many years should
we wait for ours to grow?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.490
I know what you mean,
but hearing you state it pisses me off!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:31.000
Anyway, we're going to split
into these teams today!

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.900
I won't be compared to those!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.120
Tomoe-chan!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.500
Murasame-san!
Tomoe-chan!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.420
"Those"? How rude.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.920
Well, I kind of understand her.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.520
Thank you, Kiyori-chan!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.900
Thank you! Merci! Danke schön!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.660
Have a sweet dream!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.490
Doesn't it feel a little lonely now, somehow?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.900
Not at all.

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.240
I won't let you feel lonely.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.240
Let's enjoy ourselves!

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:20.960
Oh, we're not planning on leaving you out, of course.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.780
Again! Let's do it again!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.780
Are you a kid for real?!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.080
I've had enough!
I'm going back to Tomoe-chan!

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:09.470
Isn't this just like a date? A date?!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.500
It's summer, we're at the pool,
and we're wearing swimsuits!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.100
Being a high school student is great after all!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:24.070
After this, I'm going to teach Kazama how to swim!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.030
Ah, I spilled!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.110
Spill?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.610
Sumi-chan!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.750
You're running around too much!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.260
Look, your trunk string is
about to come undone.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:41.920
They're coming off!

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.090
String?

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.970
Will you buy me a new one?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:53.050
Oh, very well. What do you want?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.640
I want fresh milk pudding!

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:58.640
Fresh... milk... pudding?!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.900
They don't sell that here.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.340
I suppose.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:06.110
Is this it — the "Return of the Accident"?!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:09.650
Could it really come to pass?
I'll take it! I'll swallow it whole!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.990
Excuse me, Miss...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.950
Thank you for waiting—

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.660
Thank you for the meal!

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:22.880
Why am I here?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.750
Well, I saw it from the pool.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:29.220
I-I can't handle s-scary things!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.220
You can't be picky, or they won't grow.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.240
This has nothing to do with that!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.560
Wh-What's going to happen?!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.480
Free fall!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.420
Oh Jesus...
Free fall!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.150
Oh Jesus...

00:07:55.540 --> 00:08:00.160
Whoa! Those are some fine specimens over there!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.540
The white one has size,
but the black one has shape!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.000
Let's go!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.290
Right!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.520
This place is bigger than I thought.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.450
It's a different kind of fun compared to the beach.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.770
The training camp was quite wearying, wasn't it?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:22.310
Well, it was a good experience since we had a memorable time together.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:27.540
I suspect there are lingering expectations, though.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.820
Ka-za-ma!

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.620
I've brought your order!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.830
Thank you, Sumi-chan!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.580
Here's yours, Hachi.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.590
Your service is impeccable today, Sumi-chan!

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.630
Indeed — today, I can do anything for you!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.890
Therefore, command me! Please, order!

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.100
Hello there, ladies!

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:01.850
Are you bored?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.600
Want to hang with us?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.730
There's a really great ride over there.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.640
Don't worry; we're perfect gentlemen.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.610
Is that a promise?

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.240
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.150
We're here with friends.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.700
No one's talking to you.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.760
Beat it, beanpole.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.040
Excuse me...

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.380
Would you shut up?!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:38.190
Get lost, fools.

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.670
We're going.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.800
Farewell!

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:46.230
Don't ever come back!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.910
They promise, huh?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.400
I see.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:10:00.910
When you're together with the two of us,
you won't be able to get any attention from the boys.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.910
Oh, I don't mind that.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.410
I don't mind that at all!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.000
Really?

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.960
You're so considerate, Sumi-chan.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.300
It's fine; you don't have to worry about us.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.050
That's not how it is.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:22.010
Besides, I don't really like
flirtatious guys like them.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:26.770
In that case, why don't you try
using the two of us as bait—

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.640
Quit it!

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.880
Sorry...

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.530
Likewise...

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:02.750
I'm sorry.

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:06.920
I got a little carried away.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:14.280
It's just that you've been spending all your time with Aoi-san recently.

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:19.150
It's been a while since we spent
some time together like this.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.780
I'm...

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:23.870
...really happy.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.160
Yes!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.370
She said she's happy, Hachi!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.960
Good for you.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.040
I'm so happy, Hachi!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.500
As I said, good for you—

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.500
All right, let's swim!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.390
Where should we go? Which pool would be the best, I wonder!

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:51.690
Calm down a bit.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.910
Where should we go next?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.950
Isn't it great that we can
go on rides in our swimsuits?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:12.210
Just so you know,
I'm going back to where Tomoe-chan is.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.540
I wonder if this Tornado Coaster is any fun.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.210
Listen to what others say!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.080
Is there one you would like to go on, Aoi-san?

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:42.950
Tomoe-chan is amazing — she barely made a splash.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.270
Yet another thing she's surprisingly good at.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:53.730
Perhaps I should give it a try too —
from the highest one.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.840
If you're going to try it,
just do it from the regular one.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:01.150
You'll end up hurting yourself if you're reckless.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:41.710
Are you all right?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.550
What did I tell you?

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.560
Don't get too cocky!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.550
The next one will be...

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.550
Let's see... swimming!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.370
A swimming competition!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.190
How did it suddenly turn into a competition?

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.230
Are you running away? You are, aren't you?

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.600
Running away?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.190
Ready!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.150
Go!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:07.140
Freestyle.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.600
Breaststroke.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.180
Backstroke.

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.760
Butterfly.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:25.130
Tomoe-chan wins...

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.350
Are you all right?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.090
Need a breather?

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.930
Still, that was amazing!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:41.190
I think it's the first time
I've seen Sumi-chan lose in sports.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.150
Did you take swimming lessons?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.340
I took a few, a long time ago.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.320
A total defeat.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:05.000
She's definitely had more than just "a few."

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.670
Still, I was really surprised.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:12.380
Back in middle school, you were faster than everyone on the swim team.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:18.720
How is it that she's still swimming
when I'm this worn out?

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:25.950
I'm sure she studied sports abroad when she took two years off.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.950
What is it?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.750
It's nothing.

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:50.880
That's right; I was supposed
to teach you how to swim.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.860
Oh, it's fine. You should rest a little.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.880
Oh, I'm just fine.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:45.480
You're quite the accomplished swimmer.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.610
Do you belong to a club somewhere?

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.060
Have you ever...

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.020
...fallen in love?

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:04.760
The distant voices of the students...

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.360
...sound like the ocean waves...

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:15.020
...and soon fade away in the gentle breeze.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:19.360
There, in that place...

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:30.880
Aoi-san!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.420
Did you find Ushio-chan and the others?

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.470
Oh, there they are.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.890
Murasame-san!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.890
Let's go and have lunch together!

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.910
Aoi-san!

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.580
How were things on your end?

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.920
As promised, I'll teach you
how to swim after lunch.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:21.930
Though, I'm not too confident
since there's a real pro around.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:26.930
I was just getting in your way, wasn't I?

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:38.690
It's nothing.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:07.470
Love is the most beautiful not when you have realized how you feel,

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:11.730
but when you are on the verge
of doing so — or so I believe.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.900
To forge ahead into the mire...

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.980
...or step back across the thorns.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.250
Either way appeals to me.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:33.660
You're quite the poet, surprisingly.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:38.350
"Surprisingly" is quite rude; however, I'm not a poet.

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:42.460
Aren't you the one with true talent?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.410
So...

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.280
...what's your opinion?

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:02.190
They like each other,
though neither has realized it yet.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:06.620
One has yet to realize her own feelings.

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.400
Quite lovely.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.210
You're surprisingly strong yourself.

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:38.350
Yo, I'm Bach!

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:39.730
Beethoven here.

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:41.270
Whose bicycle is this?!

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:43.980
A joke? A joke all of a sudden?

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.400
You just don't grasp the artistry of my sonatas!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:47.980
Fate will bury you!

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:49.610
Johann Sebastian!

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:50.950
Ludwig!
